+    /// wait for that commit, up to a short timeout, before they finish rearranging windows. An
+    /// application that calls [`Window::pre_present_notify`] before presenting doesn't block
+    /// while suspended, since winit holds back [`WindowEvent::RedrawRequested`] until the
+    /// compositor sends the next frame callback.
+    ///
